Replaces the /properties map experience with the approved Stitch masterplan
design system (project 2455613122012383700, order v2). Presentation layer
ONLY — the live-data layer (/api/inventory, publish gate, filters, search,
listing selection) is untouched and verified end-to-end.

Variant system (order § VARIANT SYSTEM): two independent pill toggles,
persisted via the site's hzp-* localStorage pattern:
- Theme: Light (Alexandria) / Dark (Nocturnal) + satellite
- Language: EN / ع / AR|EN (bilingual pills read compounds-data nameAr|nameEn)

Map engine (react-leaflet) KEPT and restyled (chrome="masterplan" prop is
opt-in; admin InventoryCommandView + ListingNetMap radar keep classic chrome):
- Compound label pills: glass, live count chips (n>0 only), sapphire/teal
  tier accents, bilingual labels, zoom-driven proximity magnification
  (11/13/16px tiers) + golden focus aura at z≥14 (owner's interaction)
- Inventory Registry Modal: floating glass spreadsheet (UNIT CODE | TYPE |
  BUA m² | PRICE | STATUS) fed by the FULL filtered live inventory; PLOT
  column dropped (no real field), STATUS conditional on real values (§21);
  row click → real detail page; 360° INSPECTION → real listing page (never
  a fake viewer); WHATSAPP VIP BROKER → wa.me/201092048333 prefilled
- Registry Benchmark HUD: live-computed Verified Units + EGP/m² price index
  (omitted when not computable); hides while the modal occupies the slot
- Cartographic chrome: gold compass, live coordinates HUD, REAL scale bar
  (measured on the map), EPSG label, zoom stack, local logo mark
- Basemap switch: CARTO → keyless Esri canvas (light base+reference labels /
  dark canvas). CARTO anonymous tiles now serve intermittent "API KEY
  REQUIRED" watermark error tiles (verified on production 2026-11-02);
  classic chrome keeps CARTO unchanged
- Filters restyled into the top-left glass overlay cluster (same state,
  behavior identical); radius control relocated into the toolbar; view
  switcher (Split/Grid/Map) on the map + map-first default per the order
- Typography: Noto Serif + Public Sans added to the existing Google Fonts
  import (Cairo already shipped); display=swap preserved

Verification: tsc clean; 34/34 vitest (15 new masterplan contract tests incl.
§21 zero-demo-value scan + no Stitch/Aida hotlinks); dev-server browser
smoke with live data — 4 variant screenshots, registry modal with 118 real
Eastown rows, focused pill + 118 unit pins at z15, toggles persisted,
zero stitch/lh3/aida network requests, zero page errors. Full next build
compiles cleanly; page-data collection OOMs in the 4GB sandbox identically
on clean main (environment limit, not a regression — Vercel build unaffected).

Known pre-existing (NOT introduced here): __tests__/map-filters-sync
Transit-zone test fails on upstream main; CARTO watermark on classic-chrome
consumers (admin/radar) unchanged.
